======================================================================
  Architecture Diagram: Phase 188 - Interview Simulation III: Strict Consistency
======================================================================

1. Simplest Baseline Architecture:
----------------------------------------------------------------------
   Using eventual consistency and asynchronous message queues for inventory checkout.

   [Client] ──▶ [Application Server] ──▶ [Primary Datastore]


2. Scaled / Resilient Architecture:
----------------------------------------------------------------------
   Temporary reservation holds with Redis TTL + ACID database transaction with row-level locks.

                               ┌──▶ [Worker Node A] ──┬──▶ [Cache]
[Client] ──▶ [Load Balancer] ──┼──▶ [Worker Node B] ──┤
                               └──▶ [Worker Node C] ──┴──▶ [Primary DB] ──▶ [Replicas]
                                         │
                                         ▼
                                   [Event Queue] ──▶ [Async Workers]

======================================================================
